# Compose

Read `docs/compose.md`. Use skill `firona-compose`.

- One process per service in the single compose file.
- Publish `${NGINX_HOST_PORT}:80` (default 8080). Backend and frontend stay internal.
- Do not fold nginx, Vite, or Django into one container.
